<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 880 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 880 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 880 contracts compared with 798 overnight Wednesday.</p>
<p>There were 123 wheat, 353 corn, 393 soybean, seven soymeal, one soyoil, one oat, one corn call and one soybean call traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 2-3/4 to 3-1/2 cents lower, corn was 1/4 to 1/2 cent lower and soybeans were one to four cents lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
